  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.<br>• Slice pumpkin into thin wedges.<br>• Cut red onion and tomato into wedges.<br>• Place pumpkin on a lined oven tray, sprinkle <br>over dried oregano (see ingredients), drizzle <br>with olive oil and season with salt. Toss to coat.<br>• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes. </p> <p><br>TIP: Peel the pumpkin if you prefer! </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/686f3e2469ddbf20131a9bbc/step-acb7cd00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Place red onion and tomato on a second lined <br>oven tray.<br>• Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt. Toss <br>to coat. Roast until tender, 15-20 minutes. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/686f3e2469ddbf20131a9bbc/step-83ce6a10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• While veggies are roasting, thinly slice leek.<br>• Roughly chop silverbeet.<br>• Finely chop garlic. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/686f3e2469ddbf20131a9bbc/step-57252d20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a large saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil<br>over medium-high heat.<br>• Cook leek, stirring, until softened, 4-5 minutes.<br>• Add silverbeet, Nan’s special seasoning and <br>garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 minute. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/686f3e2469ddbf20131a9bbc/step-c405c530.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• To the pan, stir in risoni, stock concentrate, <br>light cooking cream and the water. Bring to the <br>boil, then reduce heat to medium and simmer, <br>stirring occasionally, until the risoni is ‘al dente’ <br>and the water is absorbed, 12-15 minutes.<br>• Gently stir roast veggies through the risoni. </p> <p><br>TIP: Add a splash more water if the risoni looks dry! <br>TIP: ‘Al dente’ pasta is cooked through but still <br>slightly firm in the centre.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/686f3e2469ddbf20131a9bbc/step-b75c3640.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide creamy leek risoni between bowls.<br>• Top with oregano pumpkin. Drizzle the honey <br>over the pumpkin.<br>• Crumble over fetta cubes to serve. Enjoy!</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/686f3e2469ddbf20131a9bbc/step-0e8e7750.jpg"
    }
  ]
